{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.LocalSubstrateQ","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.LocalSubstrateQ","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.codata_ratio_in_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.codata_ratio_in_range","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L93-L101","doc":"The CODATA ratio Vol(4₁)/(m_μ/m_e) is in (0,1), ensuring\na unique q > 1 solution exists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.unique_q_solution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.unique_q_solution","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L59-L91","doc":"Uniqueness: the equation `(1 - q⁻¹)² = c` for `c > 0` has a\nunique solution `q > 1`.\n\nFrom `(1 - q⁻¹)² = c`, taking positive square root:\n`1 - q⁻¹ = √c`, so `q⁻¹ = 1 - √c`, i.e. `q = 1/(1 - √c)`.\nFor q > 1 we need `0 < √c < 1`, i.e. `0 < c < 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q_approx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q_approx","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L57-L57","doc":"q ≈ 1.1097 within experimental uncertainty. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.defining_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.defining_eq","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The defining equation: `(1 - q⁻¹)² = Vol(4₁)/(m_μ/m_e)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L53-L53","doc":"q > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.q","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The derived substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.muon_electron_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.muon_electron_ratio","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The CODATA muon-electron mass ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.vol_figure_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.vol_figure_eight","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Hyperbolic volume of the figure-eight knot.\n`Vol(4₁) = 2 Cl₂(π/3) = 6 Λ(π/3) ≈ 2.02988` — two regular ideal\ntetrahedra, each of volume `Cl₂(π/3) = 3 Λ(π/3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ","kind":"structure","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.lean#L35-L57","doc":"**Local substrate parameter determination**.\n\nThe substrate parameter q is determined by requiring that the\nlepton mass ratio prediction matches the CODATA value.\n\nq is the unique real root > 1 of:\n`(1 - q⁻¹)² = Vol(4₁) / (m_μ/m_e)` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:local-substrate-q","label":"prop:local-substrate-q","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}